{{Version history table row|3.30.0|
* [[Strongbox]]es can no longer roll Contains Identified Items or Contains Mirrored Items.
* Exceptional [[Rogue Exile]]s no longer have bonus rewards to drop their items Mirrored or to upgrade the Rarity of dropped items.
* Creating an [[Imprint]] of an item or Mirroring an item is no longer considered as Modifying the item. As a result [[Eternal Orb]]s and Mirrors of Kalandra cannot be used on items with the Can be modified while Corrupted Implicit Modifier. It also means that using these Currency items no longer removes the Forseeing effect from [[Hinekora's Lock]]s.
}}
